rLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"null\"]},\" even when your game sets it, and it will stop being populated entirely after \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"October 30, 2026\"]},\". After this date it is \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"null\"]},\" in the \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Purchase\"]},\" object, in the decoded \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"signedRequest\"]},\" payload, and in \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonA\",\"props\":{\"decoration\":\"always-underline\",\"hideExternalIcon\":false,\"href\":\"\\\/documentation\\\/games\\\/monetize\\\/iap-webhooks\",\"isMuted\":false},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"IAP Payment Webhooks\"]},\".\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Do not use \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"developerPayload\"]},\" to identify a purchase or to decide whether to deliver content. Use \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"purchaseToken\"]},\" instead \\u2014 it uniquely identifies a purchase, is included in the signed receipt, and works as an idempotency key on your server.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"In-App Purchases allow you to sell virtual goods, currency, and other digital content directly within your Instant Game.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"This guide covers everything from initial setup to advanced integration patterns, including product catalog management, SDK integration, server-side verification, and testing.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"how-iap-works\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"How IAP works\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"When a player buys something in your game, the following happens:\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonOl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Your game calls the Instant Games SDK to display available products.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"The player selects a product and confirms the purchase through the Facebook payment dialog.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Facebook processes the payment using the player\\u2019s saved payment method (credit card, PayPal, or other regional payment methods).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Your game receives a purchase confirmation with a signed receipt.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"You verify the receipt server-side and deliver the purchased content.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"The player never leaves your game during this process. The payment dialog is an overlay that appears within the Instant Games container, so the player stays in the game throughout the purchase.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"platform-support\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Platform support\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"In-App Purchases are supported on \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"all platforms\"]},\" where Instant Games are available, including iOS, Android, and the web (facebook.com). On iOS, purchases are processed through Apple\\u2019s billing system.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Regardless of platform, your game should always check for payment API availability before showing purchase UI, using \",{\"type\":\"DeveloperCode\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"FBInstant.getSupportedAPIs()\"]},\". This ensures your game handles any edge cases where payments may be temporarily unavailable on a particular client or device.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"product-types\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Product types\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"The current Instant Games Digital Fulfillment Catalog (DFC) flow supports two self-serve product types:\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"consumable-products\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Consumable products\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Consumable products are items that can be used up and purchased again. After a player buys a consumable product, you must explicitly \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"consume\"]},\" it via the SDK before the player can buy it again. Most virtual goods in games are consumables.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Examples:\"]},\" Coin packs, gem bundles, extra lives, energy refills, loot boxes, power-ups.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"non-consumable-durable-products\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Non-consumable (durable) products\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Non-consumable products are permanent, one-time purchases that persist in the player\\u2019s account indefinitely. Once purchased, a durable product cannot be bought again. You should \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"not\"]},\" consume durable products.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Examples:\"]},\" Ad removal (\\u201cRemove Ads\\u201d upgrade), premium skins, character unlocks, full game unlocks, permanent level packs.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"subscriptions---not-supported\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Subscriptions - not supported\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Subscriptions are not currently supported in Instant Games.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Subscriptions are recurring purchases that charge the player on a regular schedule (weekly, monthly, or another interval). The player is billed automatically until they cancel.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Examples:\"]},\" Monthly VIP membership, weekly battle pass, seasonal subscription with exclusive content.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"setting-up-iap\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Setting up IAP\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Before you can sell anything in your game, you need to complete several setup steps in the App Dashboard.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"step-1-enable-iap-for-your-app\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Step 1: Enable IAP for your app\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonOl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Go to the \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonA\",\"props\":{\"decoration\":\"always-underline\",\"hideExternalIcon\":false,\"href\":\"https:\\\/\\\/developers.facebook.com\\\/apps\\\/\",\"isMuted\":false},\"