hases complete successfully on iOS, Android, and web.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Error handling works correctly (cancel the purchase dialog, disconnect from the network, and so on).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"The in-game store displays localized prices from the catalog (not hardcoded prices).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Both success and failure scenarios behave as expected using the In-App Test Payment System.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"revenue-share-and-payout-schedule\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Revenue share and payout schedule\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Facebook charges a revenue share on all In-App Purchase transactions. The standard revenue share for Instant Games is \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"70\\\/30\"]},\" \\u2014 you receive 70\\u0025 of the gross revenue and Facebook retains 30\\u0025. This is consistent with industry standard rates for digital storefronts.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"payout-schedule\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Payout schedule\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Payouts are processed on a \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"monthly basis\"]},\", typically within 21 days after the end of the calendar month in which the revenue was earned. For example, revenue earned in January would be paid out by approximately February 21.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Payouts are sent to the bank account you configured in your payout account setup. You can view your earnings and payout history in the App Dashboard under \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Monetization\"]},\" > \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Payout\"]},\".\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"taxes\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Taxes\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Facebook provides tax documentation (1099 forms for US developers) but does not provide tax advice. You are responsible for reporting and paying taxes on your game revenue according to the laws of your jurisdiction. Consult a tax professional if you have questions.\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH2\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"best-practices-for-iap-design\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Best practices for IAP design\"]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"offer-a-strong-first-purchase\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Offer a strong first purchase\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonP\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"A player\\u2019s first purchase typically has the lowest conversion rate. To increase first-purchase conversion:\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonUl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Offer a \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"\\u201cStarter Pack\\u201d\"]},\" or \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"\\u201cFirst Purchase Bonus\\u201d\"]},\" priced below the value of its contents. For example, a bundle worth $5 in virtual currency for $0.99.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Show this offer at a moment when the player clearly wants something (e.g., after running out of lives for the first time).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Present the offer for a limited time (\\u201cAvailable for the first 24 hours only\\u201d) so players have a reason to act.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"price-strategically\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Price strategically\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonUl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Low entry points\"]},\" ($0.99 - $1.99) convert more players. Use these for consumables.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Mid-range bundles\"]},\" ($4.99 - $9.99) work well for currency packs and value bundles.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Premium purchases\"]},\" ($14.99 - $49.99) serve committed players. Make these feel like exceptional value compared to smaller bundles.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Always show the \",{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"best value\"]},\" label on your most profitable bundle to guide players toward it.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"make-purchases-visible-but-not-aggressive\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Make purchases visible but not aggressive\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonUl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Place your store in an easily accessible location (e.g., a \\u201cShop\\u201d button on the main menu).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Use subtle prompts at natural moments (e.g., \\u201cNeed more coins? Visit the shop!\\u201d after the player runs out).\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Never block gameplay with mandatory purchase screens. Players who feel forced will leave.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"design-consumables-for-repeat-purchases\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Design consumables for repeat purchases\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonUl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Currencies\"]},\" (coins, gems, diamonds) are the most effective consumable because they create a flexible economy and encourage repeat purchases.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Energy\\\/lives systems\"]},\" create natural purchase moments when the player runs out.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonStrong\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Bundles\"]},\" that combine multiple items (\\u201c100 coins + 3 lives + 1 shield\\u201d) feel like better value and increase average order value.\"]}]},{\"type\":\"DeveloperDMCDocsH3\",\"props\":{\"id\":\"support-non-paying-players\"},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Support non-paying players\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonUl\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Ensure that your game is enjoyable and completable without purchases. Players who feel pressured to pay will leave negative reviews and stop playing.\"]},{\"type\":\"DMCCommonLi\",\"props\":{},\"isEagerLoaded\":false,\"children\":[\"Use rewarded ads as a free alternative to purchases (e.g., watch an ad for 50 coins, or buy 500 coins fo