xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Deleting products.</strong> You can select at most 8 products for each bulk delete.</li></span></ul><div class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x14vqqas xod5an3">Deleting has a lower limit than adding because each deletion resolves more data per product on the server.</div><div class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x14vqqas xod5an3">The limits apply per operation, not to your catalog as a whole, so you can repeat an operation as many times as you need to manage a larger catalog.</div><div class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x14vqqas xod5an3">The Instant Games IAP Catalog API described below is not affected. Each request creates, updates, or deletes a single product, so there is no batch limit to observe — send one request per product.</div><div id="documentheading-3-product-catalog-best-practices"><div id="product-catalog-best-practices" style="scroll-margin-top:80px"><div class="xeuugli x2lwn1j x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1r0jzty x17zd0t2 xyamay9"><h3 class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx xv6bue1 xex5isp xsp84uj x1j402mz x1366vqa x14imz66 xby3lk6 xcxolhg xjbavb xml9wff x16b4c32 x1yyhlu9 x1i6xp69 xvyeec0 x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x1a2a7pz xxqhfby">Product catalog best practices</h3><div class="x1i10hfl x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1n2onr6 x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1hl2dhg x1lku1pv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek x197sbye x78zum5 xl56j7k x6s0dn4 x4nc2kg x155eyjv xrpzz58 x102p2p6 xus0ocu x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1td3qas x10w6t97 x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd" role="button" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="x1lliihq x1d43ie2 xlup9mm x1kky2od" role="img"><path d="M12.924 5.14c1.42-1.52 3.565-1.52 4.986 0 1.438 1.54 1.438 3.997 0 5.536l-2.007 2.138c-1.42 1.521-3.565 1.521-4.986 0a1 1 0 1 0-1.461 1.366c2.211 2.367 5.697 2.367 7.908 0l2.006-2.137c2.149-2.297 2.148-5.97.001-8.268-2.208-2.364-5.688-2.367-7.9-.01L8.582 6.71a1 1 0 0 0 1.426 1.401c.972-.989 1.97-1.957 2.917-2.97z"></path><path d="M8.23 11.91c1.427-1.4 3.618-1.399 5.045.001a1 1 0 0 0 1.4-1.427 5.556 5.556 0 0 0-7.847 0L4.66 12.623c-2.215 2.174-2.215 5.579 0 7.752a5.556 5.556 0 0 0 7.84.01l2.157-2.014a1 1 0 1 0-1.365-1.462l-2.172 2.027c-1.418 1.368-3.639 1.405-5.059.012-1.416-1.39-1.416-3.509 0-4.899L8.23 11.91z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><ul class="x1mfogq2 xrgpmi2 xtaz4m5"><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Use clear, descriptive Product IDs.</strong> You cannot change them later. Use a naming convention like <code class="x1ey7xld x1mzt3pk xnxqytt">category_item_quantity</code> (e.g., <code class="x1ey7xld x1mzt3pk xnxqytt">currency_coins_500</code>, <code class="x1ey7xld x1mzt3pk xnxqytt">powerup_shield_1</code>).</li></span><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Write player-friendly names and descriptions.</strong> These are shown in the Facebook payment dialog, so make them clear and appealing.</li></span><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Offer a range of price points.</strong> Include both low-cost impulse purchases ($0.99 - $1.99) and higher-value bundles ($4.99 - $19.99+) to capture different spending levels.</li></span><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr"><strong>Test your catalog thoroughly.</strong> Use test purchases to verify that every product displays correctly and delivers the right content.</li></span></ul><div id="documentheading-3-managing-the-catalog-via-api-v1"><div id="managing-the-catalog-via-api-v1" style="scroll-margin-top:80px"><div class="xeuugli x2lwn1j x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1r0jzty x17zd0t2 xyamay9"><h3 class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx xv6bue1 xex5isp xsp84uj x1j402mz x1366vqa x14imz66 xby3lk6 xcxolhg xjbavb xml9wff x16b4c32 x1yyhlu9 x1i6xp69 xvyeec0 x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x1a2a7pz xxqhfby">Managing the catalog via API (V1)</h3><div class="x1i10hfl x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1n2onr6 x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1hl2dhg x1lku1pv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek x197sbye x78zum5 xl56j7k x6s0dn4 x4nc2kg x155eyjv xrpzz58 x102p2p6 xus0ocu x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1td3qas x10w6t97 x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd" role="button" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="x1lliihq x1d43ie2 xlup9mm x1kky2od" role="img"><path d="M12.924 5.14c1.42-1.52 3.565-1.52 4.986 0 1.438 1.54 1.438 3.997 0 5.536l-2.007 2.138c-1.42 1.521-3.565 1.521-4.986 0a1 1 0 1