z66 xby3lk6 xcxolhg xjbavb xml9wff x16b4c32 x1yyhlu9 x1i6xp69 xvyeec0 x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x1a2a7pz xxqhfby">Offer a strong first purchase</h3><div class="x1i10hfl x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1n2onr6 x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1hl2dhg x1lku1pv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek x197sbye x78zum5 xl56j7k x6s0dn4 x4nc2kg x155eyjv xrpzz58 x102p2p6 xus0ocu x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1td3qas x10w6t97 x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd" role="button" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="x1lliihq x1d43ie2 xlup9mm x1kky2od" role="img"><path d="M12.924 5.14c1.42-1.52 3.565-1.52 4.986 0 1.438 1.54 1.438 3.997 0 5.536l-2.007 2.138c-1.42 1.521-3.565 1.521-4.986 0a1 1 0 1 0-1.461 1.366c2.211 2.367 5.697 2.367 7.908 0l2.006-2.137c2.149-2.297 2.148-5.97.001-8.268-2.208-2.364-5.688-2.367-7.9-.01L8.582 6.71a1 1 0 0 0 1.426 1.401c.972-.989 1.97-1.957 2.917-2.97z"></path><path d="M8.23 11.91c1.427-1.4 3.618-1.399 5.045.001a1 1 0 0 0 1.4-1.427 5.556 5.556 0 0 0-7.847 0L4.66 12.623c-2.215 2.174-2.215 5.579 0 7.752a5.556 5.556 0 0 0 7.84.01l2.157-2.014a1 1 0 1 0-1.365-1.462l-2.172 2.027c-1.418 1.368-3.639 1.405-5.059.012-1.416-1.39-1.416-3.509 0-4.899L8.23 11.91z"></path></svg></div></div></div></div><div class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x14vqqas xod5an3">A player’s first purchase typically has the lowest conversion rate. To increase first-purchase conversion:</div><ul class="x1mfogq2 xrgpmi2 xtaz4m5"><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr">Offer a <strong>“Starter Pack”</strong> or <strong>“First Purchase Bonus”</strong> priced below the value of its contents. For example, a bundle worth $5 in virtual currency for $0.99.</li></span><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr">Show this offer at a moment when the player clearly wants something (e.g., after running out of lives for the first time).</li></span><span class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx x3a6nna xm5vtmc x1t2x7uc x1o1n6r0 x1366vqa x1c773n9 x1k03ns3 xpbi8i2 x9820fh xml9wff xhj0du5 xrm2kyc xjprkx4 xlu1awn x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl"><li class="x1xmf6yo x1e56ztr">Present the offer for a limited time (“Available for the first 24 hours only”) so players have a reason to act.</li></span></ul><div id="documentheading-3-price-strategically"><div id="price-strategically" style="scroll-margin-top:80px"><div class="xeuugli x2lwn1j x6s0dn4 x78zum5 x1r0jzty x17zd0t2 xyamay9"><h3 class="x1motxo8 x1dg8jwx xv6bue1 xex5isp xsp84uj x1j402mz x1366vqa x14imz66 xby3lk6 xcxolhg xjbavb xml9wff x16b4c32 x1yyhlu9 x1i6xp69 xvyeec0 x12429cg x6tc29j xbq7h4v x6jdkww xq9mrsl x1a2a7pz xxqhfby">Price strategically</h3><div class="x1i10hfl x13fuv20 x18b5jzi x1q0q8m5 x1t7ytsu x9f619 x1ypdohk xdl72j9 xdt5ytf x2lah0s x3ct3a4 xdj266r x14z9mp xat24cr x1lziwak x2lwn1j xeuugli xexx8yu xyri2b x18d9i69 x1c1uobl x1n2onr6 x16tdsg8 xggy1nq x1ja2u2z x1t137rt x1hl2dhg x1lku1pv xmnv3 x7s97pk x9v5kkp xzv1bek x197sbye x78zum5 xl56j7k x6s0dn4 x4nc2kg x155eyjv xrpzz58 x102p2p6 xus0ocu x1c9tyrk xeusxvb x1pahc9y x1ertn4p x1td3qas x10w6t97 x972fbf x10w94by x1qhh985 x14e42zd" role="button" tabindex="0"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" width="1em" height="1em" aria-hidden="true" class="x1lliihq x1d43ie2 xlup9mm x1kky2od" role="img"><path d="M12.924 5.14c1.42-1.52 3.565-1.52 4.986 0 1.438 1.54 1.